invalid type: string "Document: Employee Leave Entitlements & Application Procedures\nSection: 2. Leave Exhaustion & Unpaid Leave\nContent:\n- When accrued leave balances (Annual, Sick, Maternity/Paternity) reach zero (0), further absences are treated as Leave Without Pay (LWOP).\n- LWOP requires explicit recommendation by the Head of Department (HOD) and approval by the Human Resources Director."